      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In the 19th century, Helena’s downtown sat on a land speculation deal between Sylvanus Phillips and a New York surveyor, shaping the town’s layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
